Package: sdoecon
Title: Colorado State Demography Office Economic Data Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Greg", "Totten", , "greg.totten@state.co.us", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools used by the Colorado State Demography Office to assemble
    economic and jobs data. Provides wrappers for the Moody's Analytics Data
    Buffet API, a downloader for the Bureau of Labor Statistics Quarterly
    Census of Employment and Wages (QCEW), and accessors for the office's
    economic crosswalks. Crosswalks are served from the SDO Postgres database
    via the 'sdotools' package rather than bundled with this package.
